/T (One industry that is here to stay is web design. That is, as long as the internet remains operational and a fundamental component of society. A professional or a novice would be able to learn about cutting-edge web design technologies like Parallax scroll animations, 3D graphics, augmented reality \(AR\), Dark mod, etc. with a web design certification. Hence, if somebody wishes to succeed as a web developer or UI/UX designer, getting a web design certification is the prudent course to take.)
